{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c677","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0d381-286a-7d03-bf7e-13c4c16a42b5"},"sequence":406,"recorded_at":1780531400000807,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"4603a868-01f4-4025-8e84-c5ce1f2882d9","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"4603a868-01f4-4025-8e84-c5ce1f2882d9","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"4603a868-01f4-4025-8e84-c5ce1f2882d9"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0d382-1cb7-79b2-a10a-676f63022d27"},"task_id":"01a0d382-1cb7-79b2-a10a-676f63022d27","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0d382-1cb7-79b2-a10a-676f63022d27","chunk":"Read text file `internal/cloneplanning/strategy.go`.\n1|package cloneplanning\n2|\n3|import (\n4|\t\"github.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/cloneplan\"\n5|)\n6|\n7|// This file selects the projection strategy and profile branch.\n8|// Selection is pair-neutral: it consumes only resolved boolean\n9|// signals and closed names, never concrete environment identities\n10|// or manifest bytes. Target-branch admission (the unstable refusal\n11|// and maximal-safe completeness) stays owned by\n12|// clonesnap.AdmitForTarget; SelectProfile routes the branch, the\n13|// caller admits the manifest under the returned profile. Strategy\n14|// and profile spellings stay owned by the internal/clonefidelity\n15|// and internal/cloneplan vocabularies; the literals below quote\n16|// them, and the agreement test pins the quote.\n17|\n18|// Branch is the projection branch a profile selects: target or\n19|// archive. Archive carries no Projection Plan (Section 13.14.2:\n20|// the archive report is targetless, and the projection-plan\n21|// contract forbids archive_only).\n22|type Branch string\n23|\n24|const (\n25|\t// BranchTarget carries a Projection Plan.\n26|\tBranchTarget Branch = \"target\"\n27|\t// BranchArchive carries no plan: G0/G1 closure only.\n28|\tBranchArchive Branch = \"archive\"\n29|)\n30|\n31|// Section 13.14.2 strategy spellings, quoted from the\n32|// internal/clonefidelity owner.\n33|const (\n34|\tstrategyNativeRewrite = \"same_environment_native_rewrite\"\n35|\tstrategyNativeWriter  = \"target_native_writer\"\n36|\tstrategyOfficial      = \"target_official_import\"\n37|\tstrategyContinuation  = \"continuation_context\"\n38|\tstrategyArchive       = \"archive_only\"\n39|)\n40|\n41|// profileArchive quotes the archive profile spelling.\n42|const profileArchive = \"archive_only\"\n43|\n44|// SelectStrategy selects one Section 13.14.2 strategy from resolved\n45|// pair signals. sameEnvironment reports whether source and target\n46|// share one native environment; officialImport reports whether the\n47|// target adapter offers the official_import capability;\n48|// continuation reports an explicit continuation-context request;\n49|// archive reports an explicit archive-only request. Priority is\n50|// archive, then continuation, then the pair/capability arm: an\n51|// explicit archive request always wins, an explicit continuation\n52|// request wins over the pair, a cross-environment pair with the\n53|// vendor importer uses target_official_import, a cross-environment\n54|// pair without it uses target_native_writer, and a same-environment\n55|// pair uses same_environment_native_rewrite.\n56|func SelectStrategy(sameEnvironment, officialImport, continuation, archive bool) (string, error) {\n57|\tif archive {\n58|\t\treturn strategyArchive, nil\n59|\t}\n60|\tif continuation {\n61|\t\treturn strategyContinuation, nil\n62|\t}\n63|\tif !sameEnvironment {\n64|\t\tif officialImport {\n65|\t\t\treturn strategyOfficial, nil\n66|\t\t}\n67|\t\treturn strategyNativeWriter, nil\n68|\t}\n69|\treturn strategyNativeRewrite, nil\n70|}\n71|\n72|// SelectProfile validates one requested profile and routes its\n73|// branch. archive_only routes the archive branch, which carries no\n74|// plan. The four plan profiles route the target branch; the caller\n75|// admits the capture manifest under the returned profile through\n76|// the landed clonesnap.AdmitForTarget gate. Anything else refuses\n77|// through the plan-profile gate.\n78|func SelectProfile(requested string) (Branch, string, error) {\n79|\tif !validText(requested) {\n80|\t\treturn \"\", \"\", invalid(\"projection profile is not valid UTF-8\")\n81|\t}\n82|\tif requested == profileArchive {\n83|\t\treturn BranchArchive, requested, nil\n84|\t}\n85|\tif !cloneplan.ValidPlanProfile(requested) {\n86|\t\treturn \"\", \"\", invalid(\"projection profile %q is outside strict_exact|maximal_safe|compact|messages_only|archive_only\", requested)\n87|\t}\n88|\treturn BranchTarget, requested, nil\n89|}","final_result":true}}}
