ges | 0, 9 ok | `owners.log` |\\n| `go test -p 2 -count=1` full suite, 4 shards | 0, 48 ok, 0 FAIL | `full-shard1.log` .. `full-shard4.log` |\\n| 17 configured `go test -fuzz ... -fuzztime=100x` commands | 0 all | `fuzz.log` |\\n| `go vet ./...` | 0 | `vet.log` |\\n| `GOOS=windows GOARCH=amd64 go vet ./...` | 0 | `winvet.log` |\\n| configured `test -z \\\"$(gofmt -l ...)\\\"` | 0, no files | `gofmt.log` |\\n| `go build ./...` | 0 | `build.log` |\\n| `GOOS=linux GOARCH=amd64 go build ./...` | 0 | `build-linux.log` |\\n| `GOOS=windows GOARCH=amd64 go build ./...` | 0 | `build-windows.log` |\\n| `go run ./internal/traceability/cmd/tracecheck` | 0 | `tracecheck.log` |\\n| `go run ./internal/catalog/cmd/cataloggen -adopted ... -check` | 0 | `cataloggen.log` |\\n| configured JSON validity sweep | 0 | `jsoncheck.log` |\\n| `task-board validate` | 0 (254 pre-existing board warnings, none on this task) | `board-validate.log` |\\n| `git diff --check` | 0 | `diffcheck.log` |\\n| Scratch-index `git diff --cached --check` (20 new paths) | 0 | `hygiene.log`, `scope.log` |\\n| Mutant battery, 53 rows, run 1 | 52 KILLED + control SURVIVED, 0 mismatches | `harness1-summary.log`, `harness1/` |\\n| Mutant battery, 53 rows, run 2 | 52 KILLED + control SURVIVED, 0 mismatches | `harness2-summary.log`, `harness2/` |\\n| Mutant battery, 53 rows, run 3 (final tree) | 52 KILLED + control SURVIVED, 0 mismatches | `harness3-summary.log`, `harness3/` |\\n| Census plant: new entry, no row (must redden) | 1, reflection linkage named | `census-control-plant.log` |\\n| Census plant + reflection row (must redden at table) | 1, refusal-table linkage named | `census-control-table.log` |\\n| Census revert (must pass, byte-identical) | 0 | `census-control-revert.log` |\\n| Marshal guard: second call site (must redden) | 1, sites named | `guard-control-site.log` |\\n| Marshal guard: gate removed (must redden) | 1, gate named | `guard-control-gate.log` |\\n| Escape killer on pre-fix shape (authentic failu