{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000d3c9","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0d381-286a-7d03-bf7e-13c4c16a42b5"},"sequence":2111,"recorded_at":1780531400004217,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"4603a868-01f4-4025-8e84-c5ce1f2882d9","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"4603a868-01f4-4025-8e84-c5ce1f2882d9","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"4603a868-01f4-4025-8e84-c5ce1f2882d9"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0d391-3686-7263-939f-a8a93a78b590"},"task_id":"01a0d391-3686-7263-939f-a8a93a78b590","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0d391-3686-7263-939f-a8a93a78b590","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 312-318\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-The (package, entry, input) importer outcome grid rides the\n-conformance matrix resource. Base is the story checkpoint tree;\n-the candidate adds internal/cloneplanning/* only (20 paths, no\n-landed file edited, no registry edit). Every reused owner\n-package is byte-identical base vs candidate (232 files, 0\n-differ) with green suites on both, so no input class moved; the\n-new entries are n/a on base and green on the candidate.\n+The (package, entry, input) importer outcome grid rides the\n+conformance matrix resource. Base is the story checkpoint tree;\n+the candidate adds internal/cloneplanning/* (21 paths) plus one\n+additive export in internal/clonefidelity/record.go\n+(ValidateDispositionRow, pure delegation to the existing row\n+builder, no behavior change; no registry edit). Every other\n+reused owner file is byte-identical base vs candidate (231\n+files, 0 differ) with green suites on both, so no existing\n+input class moved; the new entries and the new seam are n/a on\n+base and green on the candidate.\n","final_result":true}}}
